     2385       reposition br-list to row v-row-amount.
     2386   END.
     2387   ON HOME OF br-list IN FRAME Dlg-grp
     2388   DO:
     2389       reposition br-list to row 1.
     2390   END.
     2391   ON INSERT-MODE OF br-list IN FRAME Dlg-grp
     2392   DO:
