     2412           end.
     2413       end.
     2414   END.
     2415   ON MOUSE-SELECT-DBLCLICK OF br-list IN FRAME Dlg-grp
     2416   DO:
     2417       if temp_cgrplib_grp.mark <> "»"
     2418       and temp_cgrplib_grp.mark <> "«"
     2419       then do:
     2420           return no-apply.
