     2664   ON CHOOSE OF MENU-ITEM m_term
     2665   DO:
     2666     assign print-option = "terminal":U.
     2667     run print-grp in this-procedure(input temp_cgrplib_grp.node-code) no-error.
     2668     if error-status:error then do:
